error[const.cycle]: `a` is read while it is being built
  ╭─[<case>/src/main.av:5:1]
5 │ box a { n: c.n }
  · ┬
  · ╰── `a`'s build reaches back to it
──╯
help: a build reads what is written and other declarations — a fn it calls while building must not read `a`; hold the fn as a field instead

error[const.cycle]: `c` is read while it is being built
  ╭─[<case>/src/main.av:9:1]
9 │ box c { n: first() }
  · ┬
  · ╰── `c`'s build reaches back to it
──╯
help: a build reads what is written and other declarations — a fn it calls while building must not read `c`; hold the fn as a field instead
